        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "assurance + 的",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Sentence-final 的 can reinforce an assurance, often after 会. It is not possession and does not require an omitted noun.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他会来的。",
                "pinyin": "tā huì lái de 。",
                "meaning": "He will come, I assure you.",
                "audio": "2b88514d9b624785cfc5e0fd98b0a2fb4261b6ff7afb2997424a5b21d0b72c7d"
              },
              {
                "text": "我会帮助你的。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ huì bāngzhù nǐ de 。",
                "meaning": "I will help you, I promise.",
